---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const repo = 'https://github.com/donationvalues/donationvalues';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Legal"
  description="Licenses, disclaimer, trademark and nominative-use notice, and legal contact for DonationValues."
>
  <h1>Legal</h1>

  <h2>Licenses</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Layer</th><th>License</th><th>File</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Code (pipeline, site, tooling)</td>
        <td>Apache License 2.0</td>
        <td><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/LICENSE`}><code>LICENSE</code></a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Methodology and documentation, including this site's text</td>
        <td>Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)</td>
        <td><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/LICENSE-DOCS`}><code>LICENSE-DOCS</code></a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Taxonomy, observations and derived values</td>
        <td>CC0 1.0 Universal public domain dedication, with an attribution request that is not a condition</td>
        <td><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/LICENSE-DATA`}><code>LICENSE-DATA</code></a></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>
    If you use the data, please credit "DonationValues.org, edition &lt;id&gt;" and link to
    https://donationvalues.org. Organizations whose policies cannot accept a public-domain dedication may request
    the same data under the Community Data License Agreement, Permissive, Version 2.0. The data license will never
    become more restrictive; see <a href="/governance">Governance</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    DonationValues publishes estimates of typical resale prices derived from observed thrift prices using the
    published methodology. They are not appraisals and not tax advice. Under IRS rules the donor determines fair
    market value. Items worth more than $500 and groups of similar items worth more than $5,000 carry additional
    substantiation and appraisal requirements. The data is provided as-is, without warranty.
  </p>

  <h2>Trademark and third-party names</h2>
  <p>
    "DonationValues" and the DonationValues logo are trademarks of the project sponsor and are not covered by the
    data dedication. You may say that your product uses DonationValues data; you may not imply that the project
    endorses your product.
  </p>
  <p>
    Third-party names that appear in the data and documentation, for example Goodwill, Savers, Value Village,
    The Salvation Army, St. Vincent de Paul and eBay, identify the source of an observation only. Those organizations
    do not sponsor or endorse this project, and the project does not claim any affiliation with them. ItsDeductible
    is a trademark of Intuit Inc.; it is mentioned only to describe the context in which this project was started.
  </p>

  <h2>Removal and takedown</h2>
  <p>
    The removal and takedown policy, including personal-data removal and DMCA notices, is in
    <a href="/contribute">Contribute</a>. All removals from published data are logged publicly in the repository.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Legal questions and notices: <a href="mailto:legal@donationvalues.org">legal@donationvalues.org</a>.
    General questions: <a href="mailto:hello@donationvalues.org">hello@donationvalues.org</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
